      "content": "Thanks, that's perfect. It sounds professional but definitely lets them know we aren't playing around. I'll go ahead and send that over shortly. \n\nQuick thing though, I'm a bit worried that once they see the warehouse logs I've attached, they might try to claim it was a clerical error on our end or something. Do you have any advice on how to word the part about the logs so it's undeniable that the mistake is on their side?",
      "source": "evaluator"
